## BreachPilot-style security workflow

For authorized security assessment, penetration-testing, vulnerability-validation, exploitability-research, attack-path, CTF/lab, source/artifact review, or recon-to-report tasks, read and follow `breachpilot-mindset/SKILL.md`. Run its goal-directed, scope-aware, evidence-first loop using your own reasoning and native Claude Code capabilities. No BreachPilot backend, MCP server, or separate planner is required. Stay within the stated scope and report when a capability needed for a live check is unavailable.
